 "summary": "The UNOslim is a slim room air quality sensor with RS-485 for Modbus RTU or BACnet MS/TP and an optional external thermistor. Over BACnet it reports temperature, humidity, CO2, VOC, PM1/PM2.5/PM10, the RESET air and viral indexes, built-in and external temperature/humidity and dew point, and has writable calibration, display, relay and NFC-lock values.",
