  "AI 14 and AI 17 names are spelled Temeprature as printed.",
  "Access is printed per object (R, W, R/W); R/W is listed as W.",
  "Sensor status: read Status_Flags or Reliability.",
  "Different object set and numbering from the UNOlite and UNOnext."
